[32m+[m[32m## Working discipline[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Direct → review → understand → debug.** Build in pieces; the user reads and[m
[32m+[m[32m  can explain every piece before accepting. When asked, explain code line by[m
[32m+[m[32m  line rather than regenerating it.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The user does 1h/day with autocomplete off; don't undermine that by dumping[m
[32m+[m[32m  large unrequested code blocks during learning blocks.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Work on a `dayN` branch, never directly on `main`.[m
