[32m+[m[32m## Hard rules (never violate)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Secrets:** only in `.env`, which is git-ignored. Never print, commit, or[m
[32m+[m[32m  echo the API key. If `.env` shows up in `git status`, stop and fix[m
[32m+[m[32m  `.gitignore` first.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **No confidential or employer data — ever.** Public or synthetic data only.[m
[32m+[m[32m  Nothing resembling a JSSFML document, template, contract, or delegate list.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **No scratch files in commits.** `scratch_*.py` is deleted before commit.[m
